subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Show spending vs budget and detect budget overruns

USAGE:
  subtrack budget <OPTIONS>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                         Display this help message
  -v, --version                      Display this version
  --check                            Exit with code 1 when over budget (for scripts)
  --period <period>                  Period: monthly, yearly (default: monthly)
  -c, --currency <currency>          Convert all prices to target currency
  --name <name>                      Compare against a named budget (config budgets)
  -j, --json                         Output as JSON

